# Drives `147_negation_ended`. A Sensor raises the Alarm in the first pump;
# an Ack for another entity leaves it standing in the second; an Ack for the
# Sensor's entity ends `alarm`'s match in the third, which withdraws the
# Alarm. `verify tms` judges every pump on both legs, `no` included.
assert Sensor entity_id=e1
pump
assert Ack entity_id=e2
pump
assert Ack entity_id=e1
pump
